Third-party notices for the myna-sherpa snap
============================================

Model components
----------------

model-fastconformer-480ms: k2-fsa's int8 ONNX export
(https://huggingface.co/csukuangfj/sherpa-onnx-nemo-streaming-fast-conformer-transducer-en-480ms-int8)
of NVIDIA's stt_en_fastconformer_hybrid_large_streaming_multi checkpoint,
Copyright NVIDIA Corporation, licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution
4.0 International License (CC-BY-4.0,
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). The export changes the storage
format and quantises to int8; no model was retrained.

model-punct-en: k2-fsa's ONNX conversion of Edge-Punct-Casing
(https://arxiv.org/abs/2407.13142), Apache License, Version 2.0, fetched from
the sherpa-onnx `punctuation-models` release
(https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/releases/tag/punctuation-models).

